# SCRATCH patch of t0-gumm, never commit to src. With TERTIUS_X_FROZEN=1 a capture right after a capture (a step of 0 s) is no still: it draws once and keeps every history, so that a run of capture steps films a fixed state of the world (the sun and the station's turn held) one draw at a time. It applies after scratch-first-filmed.patch. Without the variable nothing changes.
